_:subclass-035 tdn:qualification "The edge does not impose general Solution Component requirements on the Gray Network router." .
_:subclass-035 tdn:rationale "The availability example identifies an ordinary router on each Gray Network as the device that selects an outer component." .
_:subclass-035 tdn:sourceUnit <urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p021:u008.s003> .
_:subclass-036 rdf:type owl:Axiom .
_:subclass-036 owl:annotatedProperty rdfs:subClassOf .
_:subclass-036 owl:annotatedSource tdn:ROLE-screening-router .
_:subclass-036 owl:annotatedTarget tdn:ROLE-router .
_:subclass-036 tdn:basis "source_interpretation" .
_:subclass-036 tdn:qualification "The source excludes the screening router from the MSC Solution itself." .
_:subclass-036 tdn:rationale "The source describes a screening router as a router used to filter packets from Black Networks." .
_:subclass-036 tdn:sourceUnit <urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p026:u010.s002> .
_:subclass-037 rdf:type owl:Axiom .
_:subclass-037 owl:annotatedProperty rdfs:subClassOf .
_:subclass-037 owl:annotatedSource tdn:ROLE-customer-edge-router .
_:subclass-037 owl:annotatedTarget tdn:ROLE-router .
_:subclass-037 tdn:basis "source_interpretation" .
_:subclass-037 tdn:qualification "The example does not make all Customer Edge Routers Screening Routers." .
_:subclass-037 tdn:rationale "The source names a Customer Edge Router as an existing Black Network router that can provide the screening realization." .
