_:subclass-039 owl:annotatedProperty rdfs:subClassOf .
_:subclass-039 owl:annotatedSource tdn:ROLE-kgs .
_:subclass-039 owl:annotatedTarget tdn:ROLE-solution-component .
_:subclass-039 tdn:basis "source_interpretation" .
_:subclass-039 tdn:qualification "The edge identifies the KGS category in the source solution. It does not require the pre-shared-key option in every deployment." .
