<urn:tdn:csfc:msc:roles> rdf:type owl:Ontology .
<urn:tdn:csfc:msc:roles> rdfs:comment "A class describes entities matching an extracted role or realization concept. Classes may overlap and may have multiple parents. No device existence, class disjointness, or class equivalence is asserted. Non-subtype links are OWL annotation assertions between class IRIs. They preserve source context without imposing object-property restrictions or asserting a relationship for every class member." .
