tdn:ROLE-aw tdn:theoryInterpretation "V31-012: Credential separation applies to the selected certificate or shared-key method. Management-device presence and separation are required only when managementSelected is true. Different network names do not imply different full security levels." .
tdn:ROLE-aw tdn:theoryInterpretation "V31-047: Administrative Workstations are optional. When deployed, administrator accounts and active sessions must bind each accepted operation to the appropriate individual and prior authentication. Certificate and NIST objectives add their selected assurance conditions." .
