tdn:ROLE-enterprise-ca tdn:theoryInterpretation "V31-013: The Gray path specification distinguishes Inner components, Gray Firewalls, workstations, locally run CAs, all CAs and revocation services. Gray AWs and locally run CAs follow the highest-level convention. The broader service-path requirements retain each service’s actual level." .
