tdn:ROLE-gray-aw tdn:theoryInterpretation "V31-013: The Gray path specification distinguishes Inner components, Gray Firewalls, workstations, locally run CAs, all CAs and revocation services. Gray AWs and locally run CAs follow the highest-level convention. The broader service-path requirements retain each service’s actual level." .
tdn:ROLE-gray-aw tdn:theoryInterpretation "V31-047: Administrative Workstations are optional. When deployed, administrator accounts and active sessions must bind each accepted operation to the appropriate individual and prior authentication. Certificate and NIST objectives add their selected assurance conditions." .
