tdn:ROLE-gray-firewall tdn:theoryInterpretation "V31-013: The Gray path specification distinguishes Inner components, Gray Firewalls, workstations, locally run CAs, all CAs and revocation services. Gray AWs and locally run CAs follow the highest-level convention. The broader service-path requirements retain each service’s actual level." .
tdn:ROLE-gray-firewall tdn:theoryInterpretation "V31R-033: Mandatory MTU bounds include Inner Gray interfaces, Outer Black interfaces and applicable Gray Firewall external interfaces. The separate Inner fragmentation-reduction objective remains optional." .
