tdn:ROLE-gray-management tdn:theoryInterpretation "V31-012: Credential separation applies to the selected certificate or shared-key method. Management-device presence and separation are required only when managementSelected is true. Different network names do not imply different full security levels." .
tdn:ROLE-gray-management tdn:theoryInterpretation "V31-013: The Gray path specification distinguishes Inner components, Gray Firewalls, workstations, locally run CAs, all CAs and revocation services. Gray AWs and locally run CAs follow the highest-level convention. The broader service-path requirements retain each service’s actual level." .
tdn:ROLE-gray-router rdf:type owl:Class .
