tdn:ROLE-gray-router tdn:leanExpression "Device.kind = .ordinaryGrayRouter" .
tdn:ROLE-gray-router tdn:leanMapping "An ordinary Gray router has the router kind, no encryption layer and no infrastructure flag. It has at least one Gray interface; every other interface is Gray or local. Local includes device-internal interfaces such as loopback." .
tdn:ROLE-gray-router tdn:leanReference "Deployment.OrdinaryGray at TDN/Targets/ComplianceModel.lean:668" .
