tdn:ROLE-gray-router tdn:sourceUnit <urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p021:u008.s004> .
tdn:ROLE-gray-router tdn:theoryInterpretation "V31-056-074: Ordinary Gray routing and switching infrastructure has a narrowly defined exemption from component duties. OrdinaryGray requires the matching kind, no encryption layer or infrastructure flag, at least one Gray interface, and only Gray or local interfaces. Standalone encapsulators retain their applicable duties." .
