tdn:ROLE-inner-vpn tdn:theoryInterpretation "V31-007: V3.1 separates encryption mechanism, Inner/Outer layer, interface zone and full security level. Flow.Valid binds the two tunnel endpoints and independent key contexts. AuthenticationServices requires a CA or key-generation service according to each component’s selected authentication method. Workstations are optional under the current scope." .
tdn:ROLE-inner-vpn tdn:theoryInterpretation "V31R-033: Mandatory MTU bounds include Inner Gray interfaces, Outer Black interfaces and applicable Gray Firewall external interfaces. The separate Inner fragmentation-reduction objective remains optional." .
