tdn:ROLE-key-management-component tdn:theoryInterpretation "V31-012: Credential separation applies to the selected certificate or shared-key method. Management-device presence and separation are required only when managementSelected is true. Different network names do not imply different full security levels." .
tdn:ROLE-key-management-component tdn:theoryInterpretation "V31-027: The key server is an endpoint function. MACsecServerPair and the actual central-management-site declaration determine the server’s placement. Approved key-generation provenance remains an explicit authority condition, including the chosen EAP-derived CAK interpretation." .
