tdn:ROLE-kgs tdn:theoryInterpretation "V31-027: The key server is an endpoint function. MACsecServerPair and the actual central-management-site declaration determine the server’s placement. Approved key-generation provenance remains an explicit authority condition, including the chosen EAP-derived CAK interpretation." .
