tdn:ROLE-solution-component tdn:theoryInterpretation "V31-015: When built-in encapsulation is unavailable, the selected standalone encapsulator must have the required Inner-side and Outer-side attachments and satisfy its applicable component duties. The current RG-015 definition preserves those duties despite the source passage describing encapsulation as outside the solution boundary." .
