tdn:ROLE-supplicant tdn:theoryInterpretation "V31-024: A MACsec device supports supplicant and authenticator functions across arrangements. EAPRole describes those functions separately from DeviceKind. The AS is bound to one site network in the selected interpretation; one AS must not bridge Red and Gray or several site networks." .
tdn:ROLE-switch rdf:type owl:Class .
tdn:ROLE-switch rdfs:comment "Device alternative for standalone encapsulation or Gray infrastructure forwarding; switching as an activity is not an instance." .
